# Untitled

## Atomically dispersed N-coordinated Fe-Fe dual-sites with enhanced enzyme-like activities
Lei Jiao\(^{1,\S}\), Wei Ye\(^{2,\S}\), Yikun Kang\(^{3,\S}\), Yu Zhang\(^{1}\), Weiqing Xu\(^{1}\), Yu Wu\(^{1}\), Wenling Gu\(^{1}\), Weiyu Song\(^{3}\) (✉), Yujie Xiong\(^{4}\) (✉), and Chengzhou Zhu\(^{1}\) (✉)
